y thanks to his love of alcohol.\n- A mixture between farmer clothing and steampunk aesthetics, if it is possible. He is good with mechanics and blacksmithing, hence why I ask for slight steampunk tweaks if possible.\n- A friendly expression! He may be a country bumpkin but he is nice.\n- A few scars here and there on his body. He works hard and may look rugged on the surface, but still retains his easygoing nature.\n\nI hope this makes sense! Feel free to draw whatever feels right to you. Thank you for your consideration!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tonokobb/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1062661, "client_id": 576289, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f575e28d/uploads/origins/c86cef8a-5053-41ba-947b-7b6bb7956256?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70e7d7d65c597600ef3db08f18756d4c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f575e28d/uploads/origins/c86cef8a-5053-41ba-947b-7b6bb7956256?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70e7d7d65c597600ef3db08f18756d4c, https://si.imgix.net/f575e28d/uploads/origins/c86cef8a-5053-41ba-947b-7b6bb7956256?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a6dba3811d48b772776e9eb91cb2a64 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f575e28d/uploads/origins/c86cef8a-5053-41ba-947b-7b6bb7956256?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efc0960a2a0b22fc1c04327deb08620e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f575e28d/uploads/origins/c86cef8a-5053-41ba-947b-7b6bb7956256?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a0308989a33a748fd6844fece6b88562", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f575e28d/uploads/origins/c86cef8a-5053-41ba-947